    ],
    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me by Section 27(1) of the Universities Act, No. 16 of 1978, I, Dr. WijayadasaRajapaksa, Minister of Higher Education and Cultural Affairs, on the recommendation of the University Grants Commission,do by this Order, amend the Schedule to the Order made under Section 21 of the said Act, published in GazetteExtraordinary No. 281/7 of January 24, 1984 (as last amended by Order published in Gazette Extraordinary,No. 2037/ 16 of September 21, 2017), establishing the University of Ruhuna, Sri Lanka, by the addition immediatelyafter the entry \u2018\u20188. Department of English and Linguistics\u2019\u2019 in Column II of the Schedule which corresponds to the item\u2018\u2018 Faculty of Humanities and Social Sciences\u2019\u2019 in Column I of that Schedule, of the following entry :-",
